  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the 2005-2009 Integral Anti-corruption Programme, PIA, is &quot;to strengthen the institutional capacity of four participating entities with legal mandate to effectively fight against corruption&quot;.The four participating institutions are the Office of the Comptroller General, the Public Ministry, the Financial Investigations Unit and the Viceministry of Fight Against Corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
